// Description:
// Title-screen main menu, now merged inside the startup scene (scenes/minimal.scene)
// instead of living on its own dedicated scene. The panel is state-gated: it renders
// only while GameManager.GetLocalGameState() == LocalGameState.InMainMenu (the opaque
// backdrop sits INSIDE the gate, so it can never cover gameplay). PLAY calls
// GameManager.StartGame(); SETTINGS opens the engine settings modal (mirrors
// EscMenu.OpenSettings); HOW TO PLAY opens a paginated rules/controls modal; CREDITS
// opens a small inline modal; QUIT closes the game (mirrors EscMenu/EndGame's
// Game.Close()). Also shows a compact Top-N leaderboard to the left of the menu
// column. Self-contained inline @code, no code-behind
// partial - mirrors EscMenu/BarMenu so there's no cross-file Rider
// codebehind-resolution trap to worry about.
